<figure class="learning-loop" aria-labelledby="loop-title">
  <figcaption id="loop-title">From city intent to a revised initiative</figcaption>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>City intent</strong><span>Improve flow while people can cross safely.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Shared information</strong><span>Engineers review the layout, arrival data and queue rule.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Agent-assisted model</strong><span>An agent can draft a model and help run a comparison.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Review the result</strong><span>Engineers check the rule and simulated rows.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Revise the initiative</strong><span>Engineers decide what to record and investigate next.</span></li>
  </ol>
  <p>↶ The reviewed initiative and its reason become shared information for the next question.</p>
</figure>
